title: Be humble.
pid: d286c355-d36d-427a-a62a-776571b45ecb
body: |2-
  From all that I have seen, you have the humility, confidence
  and peace of mind to be unperturbed by
  being discussed in a conversation they are not part of.
  We all have the freedom to read each others' notes;
  I doubt anyone will have the time or desire
  to go looking for gossip,
  but you are free to look for yourself in others' notes,
  and sometimes you may be invited to do so.
